    "description": "An exciting career opportunity awaits you at AIIMS Delhi Ventures Solutions. We are on the lookout for a dedicated Surgeon to strengthen our Bengaluru-based team.\n\nAbout AIIMS Delhi Ventures Solutions:\nAIIMS Delhi Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Diagnose and treat medical conditions following established protocols\n• Collaborate with pharmaceutical representatives and medical suppliers\n• Provide high-quality patient care and maintain patient records\n• Participate in quality improvement initiatives and clinical audits\n• Ensure patient privacy and maintain confidentiality\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Patient Care\n• Proficiency in CPT Codes\n• Proficiency in Medical Coding\n• Proficiency in Medical Terminology\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in Clinical Documentation\n• Proficiency in Diagnostic Skills\n• Proficiency in Surgical Procedures\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Bengaluru, Karnataka, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with AIIMS Delhi Ventures Solutions!",
